+## Objective
+Round 1 built `evaluate-reports.py security` and moved the project roots to `~/.cursor-bridge/projects.json`. That work is committed at HEAD on branch `task-077` (round 1's report: `handoff/TASK-077-r1-report.md`). Review A rejected it and the security audit blocked it. This round fixes round 1's code so that each of the supervisor's sixteen rulings below holds. Every requirement of round 1 still stands too. This brief restates them, and it governs where it differs from `handoff/TASK-077.md`, which you may read as context.
