+- never let a standing finding cut the week's classification short;
+- read the alerts for every project with a remote;
+- write each failed read with a fixed phrase that names the read and the failure;
+- write only printable ASCII;
+- refuse every unexpected reply shape as a failed read, never with a traceback;
+- choose runs by parsed time;
+- harden the git call and the projects file's reading;
+- restore pace-report's default-root order and naming.
+
