+**Ruling 7. Reading the projects file.** The projects file is read with encoding `utf-8-sig`, so a byte-order mark is accepted. A file that does not decode (UTF-16, bad bytes) is refused with its reason (the file is not UTF-8 text), with exit 2 and no traceback. The file is read from `os.path.expanduser("~")` only. `--home` (the session records' home) never chooses it, in `evaluate-reports.py` and `pace-report.py` alike. Faults:
