+R5. **The reads.** Every read is `bridge_env.GH_COMMAND + ["api", ...]` by GET. Never pass `-X`/`--method`, any field or input option, `--jq`, `--template` or `--slurp`. Each read is one attempt under `bridge_env.GH_API_TIMEOUT` (30 s), with no retry. In this order:
